flowchart LR
    subgraph Sources[Mininet hosts]
        Agents[Agent frameworks]
        Human[Human traffic]
        Bulk[Background load]
    end

    subgraph Switch[BMv2 simple_switch - agent_aware.p4]
        Parser[Parser<br/>Ethernet / IPv4 / TCP / UDP / TLS-CH]
        Features[Flow state<br/>EWMA / sizes / fan-out sketch]
        Classifier[Decision tree<br/>range-match tables]
        Action[QoS action<br/>DSCP / queue / ECN / meter]
        Parser --> Features --> Classifier --> Action
    end

    Target[MCP server and web target]
    Controller[Ryu controller<br/>policy / punts / reclassification]
    ML[Offline ML<br/>pcap -> features -> tree -> table entries]

    Agents --> Parser
    Human --> Parser
    Bulk --> Parser
    Action --> Target
    Switch -. first-packet punts and register reads .-> Controller
    Controller -. idempotent table and policy writes .-> Switch
    ML -. compiled tree JSON .-> Controller
